    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3640" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρο-στόλιον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>terminal ornament</i> of
			ship (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄφλαστον</span>), crowning
			either the stern-post, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Alm.</u>
				8.1
			</span></i>; or more commonly, the stem-post, <i><span class="en">
				Callix.
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Demetr.</u>
				43
			</span></i>; taken as trophy, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				3.4.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				18.75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Mith.</u>
				25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Polyaen.
				4.6.9
			</span></i>.</div>
